+---
+id: lem-qftx-holonomy-incidence-codimension
+kind: lemma
+title: Dimension of the finite holonomy incidence manifold
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+domain: mathematics
+library: mathematics
+category: quantum-field-theory-mathematics
+dependency_level: 1
